--- stderr ---
error: review-receipt capture: reviewreceipt: feature name is required

$ review-receipt capture --cwd <ROOT> --feature    
exit: 1
--- stdout ---
--- stderr ---
error: review-receipt capture: reviewreceipt: feature name is required

$ review-receipt capture --cwd <ROOT> --feature ../escaped
exit: 1
--- stdout ---
--- stderr ---
error: review-receipt capture: reviewreceipt: feature name "../escaped" is not a safe path component: it holds a path separator

$ review-receipt capture --cwd <ROOT> --feature a/b
exit: 1
--- stdout ---
--- stderr ---
error: review-receipt capture: reviewreceipt: feature name "a/b" is not a safe path component: it holds a path separator

$ review-receipt capture --cwd <ROOT> --feature ..
exit: 1
--- stdout ---
--- stderr ---
error: review-receipt capture: reviewreceipt: feature name ".." is not a safe path component: it is a dot segment

$ review-receipt capture --cwd <ROOT> --feature  padded
exit: 1
